- replace the weak complementary leg with another high-coverage resample leg
- merge in `log1p` space instead of raw prediction space
- learn or derive non-negative normalized blend weights from the holdout
- shrink the learned/log-space blend back toward leg 1 with a tiny preset `alpha` search
